abstract: >-
  Airspeed indicator, attitude indicator, altimeter, turn coordinator,
  heading indicator and vertical speed indicator for Jupyter, marimo and
  other anywidget hosts, built on the anywidget-instruments core. For
  visualization, teaching and simulation: not certified avionics.
